OL,3,GNEWSAHomes target 'risks changing the
OL,4,Acharacter of the Cotswolds'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA controversial housing target set by
OL,7,Fthe government is at risk of "changing
OL,8,Fthe character of the Cotswolds," says a
OL,9,Flocal MP.
OL,11,FCotswold District Council's housing
OL,12,Ftarget has been more than doubled from
OL,13,F500 to more than 1,000 a year.
OL,15,FThe plans have generated significant
OL,16,Fbacklash in affected areas and would
OL,17,Flead to an approximate 40% increase on
OL,18,Fthe district's current 44,000 homes
OL,19,Fover 20 years.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
