OL,3,GNEWSAHomes target 'risks changing the
OL,4,Acharacter of the Cotswolds'
OL,5,
OL,6,FSouth Cotswolds MP Roz Savage and
OL,7,Fcouncil leader Mike Evemy met with
OL,8,FMinister for Housing, Communities and
OL,9,FLocal Government Baroness Taylor of
OL,10,FStevenage but said they were told
OL,11,Ftargets were not going to be lowered.
OL,12,FThe ministry said all areas needed to
OL,13,Fto "play their part" in tackling the
OL,14,Fhousing crisis.
